            "name": "Kreed: Battle for Savitar",
            "steam_appid": 289710,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This took place shortly before the events of Kreed. The second half of the 23rd century became a turning point in human history. The Solar System has been occupied by the bloodthirsty Tiglaari Empire. The actions of this ruthless aggressor are aimed at the extermination of humanity as a species. However, Earth has something to oppose the invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you lies the story of a legendary Legion, destined in the distant future to reshape Earth’s civilization and lead its mission among the stars. A future in which humanity will achieve victory in the decisive battle for the Savitar space station.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A future you can change…</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The long-awaited sequel to the acclaimed shooter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New locations (Pluto, the Asteroid Belt, the Tiglaari Base, Savitar).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New weapon types (shocker, laser sniper rifle).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New environmental hazards (poisonous gases, airless space).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New special effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skeletal animation for enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to record gameplay in “demo” mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved lighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New enemies (the Raider race, the Gerdj race, the Tiglaari race).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic in-game physics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We would like to thank our fans for their excellent work in localizing the game into English!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translation by  <strong>Sam J.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice actors: <strong>Luchian D.</strong>, <strong>Jillian Anitova</strong>, <strong>Bob Nomad</strong>.</p>",
